      "body": "You know ten everyday verbs and can build your first present-tense sentences.",
      "keyPoints": [
        "Infinitive = stem + na: jaana, khaana, bolna, dena…",
        "Everyday present: subject + object + gendered verb + helper (haan/ho)",
